{"id":"9fe494d9579129b3","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-modal-character-partition.md","title":"Partition and Matching Properties of Modal Characters","display":"lem-modal-character-partition — Partition and Matching Properties of Modal Characters","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-modal-character-partition","aliases":["89-lem-modal-character-partition"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-modal-character-partition — Partition and Matching Properties of Modal Characters","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-characters]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-modal-character-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-modal-character-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modal-character-partition — Partition and Matching Properties of Modal Characters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9951d1dd53a3ed60\" href=\"?note=9951d1dd53a3ed60\" title=\"89-df-modal-characters\">89-df-modal-characters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle\">\\(Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(X,S,U)\">\\(N=(X,S,U)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 模型。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\)</span> 是固定语法 character 集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)\">\\(\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)\\)</span> 是下文唯一选取的 character，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 为模态度数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}character\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;\\mathrm{md}(C)\\le m,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists!C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&amp;\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)\\coloneqq\\iota C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&amp;\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;s\\;(M,w\\models q_i\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models q_i),\\\\\n&amp;m&gt;0\\land\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to\\exists y\\in X\\;\n(xSy\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;(xSy\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}character\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;\\mathrm{md}(C)\\le m,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists!C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&amp;\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)\\coloneqq\\iota C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&amp;\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;s\\;(M,w\\models q_i\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models q_i),\\\\\n&amp;m&gt;0\\land\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to\\exists y\\in X\\;\n(xSy\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;(xSy\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 114–115；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>每个模型世界唯一确定各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span> 和各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond U_j\">\\(\\Diamond U_j\\)</span> 的二值真值，选择这些比特恰给一个成立的 character；两个不同选择有一对相反文字，不能同真。因此唯一描述合法。度数界从递归直接归纳。\n匹配性质：任取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 满足唯一低一阶 character <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\models\\Diamond C\">\\(w\\models\\Diamond C\\)</span>。共同高阶 character 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 也含正的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond C\">\\(\\Diamond C\\)</span>，于是有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xSy\">\\(xSy\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。逆向交换模型即可。无需有限、传递或 GL 条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-characters","status":"resolved","id":"9951d1dd53a3ed60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-characters]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"N=(X,S,U)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}character\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;\\mathrm{md}(C)\\le m,\\\\\n&\\exists!C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)\\coloneqq\\iota C\\in\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\;(M,w\\models C),\\\\\n&\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i<s\\;(M,w\\models q_i\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models q_i),\\\\\n&m>0\\land\\chi_{Q,m}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,m}(N,x)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\left[\\forall v\\in W\\;(wRv\\to\\exists y\\in X\\;\n(xSy\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;(xSy\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\land\\chi_{Q,m-1}(M,v)=\\chi_{Q,m-1}(N,y)))\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond U_j","display":false},{"tex":"wRv","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"w\\models\\Diamond C","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond C","display":false},{"tex":"xSy","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":2067,"backlinks":[{"id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-modal-character-partition]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["9951d1dd53a3ed60","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}